  "purpose": "Specify one common, explicit candidate visibility-window rule for the fourteen enabled D9.9 editorial field instances across Challenges, Visual Loops and Visual Drills. The contract preserves the distinct D9.9 universal-field namespace, does not alias Challenge phase fields, and grants no consumer or renderer authorization.",
